Package: com.legacyfixes.youtubekids
Name: LegacyFix: YouTube Kids
Version: 1.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Keeps YouTube Kids usable now that its native backend is gone by handing the app over to youtubekids.com in an in-app browser (configurable URL/delay), with update-nag suppression and the shared LegacyFixes engine.
Maintainer: LegacyFixes
Author: LegacyFixes
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 7.0), firmware (<< 10.0)
